{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Swing, grapple and navigate unique environments.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tentaphages are agile creatures. They can stick to various surfaces and use their tentacles to launch themselves great distances.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854760/extras/84595ddddbebd335453c1a0695e74bc1.poster.avif?t=1755241837\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854760/extras/84595ddddbebd335453c1a0695e74bc1.webm?t=1755241837\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854760/extras/84595ddddbebd335453c1a0695e74bc1.mp4?t=1755241837\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Control human minds.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tentaphages can seize control of others, forcing them to carry out their will. But crewmates don\u2019t take kindly to seeing a parasite latched onto a friend\u2019s back\u2014expect them to open fire the moment they spot you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854760/extras/48b5898a3df3d4266b7878739adc208c.poster.avif?t=1755241837\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854760/extras/48b5898a3df3d4266b7878739adc208c.webm?t=1755241837\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854760/extras/48b5898a3df3d4266b7878739adc208c.mp4?t=1755241837\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unlock customizations for your Tentaphage.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Change to your favorite color any time. Want more variety? Unlock 13 different custom themed Tentaphages through the Steam Achievement system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854760/extras/3bc081351faa97d96458e0c9a41c9e70.poster.avif?t=1755241837\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854760/extras/3bc081351faa97d96458e0c9a41c9e70.webm?t=1755241837\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854760/extras/3bc081351faa97d96458e0c9a41c9e70.mp4?t=1755241837\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unlock the secrets of the lore behind an evolving universe.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Across the known universe, a mysterious species of Tentaphages have begun to appear\u2014and their colossal Mother is slowly falling apart.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A crew discovers a strange shard of an interdimensional goddess over halfway through their 60 year wavering voyage to recover Epsilon Material (EpsMat), a volatile substance rumored to warp space-time itself. The crew finds their ship is being invaded by these unknown creatures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Piece together the truth through scattered notes, cryptic dialogue, and the dangerous encounters that await you in the void.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3854760?t=1755241837","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854760/e777b03486135486de57e5b5d20eb8b4f2d345a2/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1755241837","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854760/eaee1b58141fb72071383fc681d61797398eaa11/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1755241837","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854760/eaee1b58141fb72071383fc681d61797398eaa11/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1755241837","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Surround Sound","id":70},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Swing, grapple and navigate unique environments.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tentaphages are agile creatures. They can stick to various surfaces and use their tentacles to launch themselves great distances.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854760/extras/84595ddddbebd335453c1a0695e74bc1.poster.avif?t=1755241837\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854760/extras/84595ddddbebd335453c1a0695e74bc1.webm?t=1755241837\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854760/extras/84595ddddbebd335453c1a0695e74bc1.mp4?t=1755241837\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Control human minds.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tentaphages can seize control of others, forcing them to carry out their will. But crewmates don\u2019t take kindly to seeing a parasite latched onto a friend\u2019s back\u2014expect them to open fire the moment they spot you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854760/extras/48b5898a3df3d4266b7878739adc208c.poster.avif?t=1755241837\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854760/extras/48b5898a3df3d4266b7878739adc208c.webm?t=1755241837\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854760/extras/48b5898a3df3d4266b7878739adc208c.mp4?t=1755241837\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unlock customizations for your Tentaphage.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Change to your favorite color any time. Want more variety? Unlock 13 different custom themed Tentaphages through the Steam Achievement system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854760/extras/3bc081351faa97d96458e0c9a41c9e70.poster.avif?t=1755241837\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854760/extras/3bc081351faa97d96458e0c9a41c9e70.webm?t=1755241837\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854760/extras/3bc081351faa97d96458e0c9a41c9e70.mp4?t=1755241837\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unlock the secrets of the lore behind an evolving universe.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Across the known universe, a mysterious species of Tentaphages have begun to appear\u2014and their colossal Mother is slowly falling apart.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A crew discovers a strange shard of an interdimensional goddess over halfway through their 60 year wavering voyage to recover Epsilon Material (EpsMat), a volatile substance rumored to warp space-time itself. The crew finds their ship is being invaded by these unknown creatures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Piece together the truth through scattered notes, cryptic dialogue, and the dangerous encounters that await you in the void.</p>","developers":["Worn Software"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3854760/4000316cc5a70c2d0e04e5751ebb0f230bbc2eff/header.jpg?t=1755241837","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257183535,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257183535/movie480.mp4?t=1755241835","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257183535/movie_max.mp4?t=1755241835"},"name":"Tentaphage Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257183535/30eaf07b08048d6f7041d04cd86860bd18bb7462/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1755241835","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257183535/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1755241835","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257183535/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1755241835"}}],"name":"Tentaphage","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GTX 1060<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["Worn Software"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Viol\u00eancia\nLinguagem impr\u00f3pria","rating":"14","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"14","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Drastische Gewalt\nSchimpfw\u00f6rte","rating":"16","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"16","use_age_gate":"0"}},"release_date":{"coming_soon":true,"date":"29 Aug, 2025"},"required_age":0,"screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_fu